    {
      "source": "Resolves a <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>. Resolution typically uses <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/JdbcOperations.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcOperations</code></a> to obtain and inspect a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Connection</code></a>. Dialect resolution uses Spring's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>spring.factories</code></a> to determine\navailable <a href=\"DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect\"><code>extensions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析一个<a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>。解析过程通常使用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/JdbcOperations.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcOperations</code></a>来获取并检查一个\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Connection</code></a>。方言解析使用 Spring 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>spring.factories</code></a>来确定可用的\n<a href=\"DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect\"><code>extensions</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Exception thrown when <a href=\"DialectResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver</code></a> cannot resolve a <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>.",
      "translation": "抛出异常，因为无法通过<a href=\"DialectResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver</code></a>解析<a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "SPI to extend Spring's default JDBC Dialect discovery mechanism.",
      "translation": "SPI 将扩展 Spring 默认的 JDBC 方言发现机制。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the resolved <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a> <a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver.NoDialectException</code></a> if the database type cannot be determined from\n        <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "抛出已解析的<a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a><a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver.NoDialectException</code></a>异常，如果无法从<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a>确定数据库类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect\">DialectResolver.NoDialectException</a></code> - if no <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a> can be found.",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect\">DialectResolver.NoDialectException</a></code> - 如果找不到任何 <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
